# Agent workflow

## Definition of done

Before reporting work finished:

1. Run `pnpm lint`, `pnpm typecheck`, and `pnpm test` for every package you touched.
2. Cross-package changes → run `pnpm verify` (or the subset CI runs for that scope).
3. If a command cannot run here, say so explicitly — never claim a pass without running it.

## Do not silence checks

```text
❌ New eslint-disable / @ts-ignore / @ts-nocheck
❌ Lower coverage thresholds, ESLint limits, or audit ignoreGhsas without user approval
❌ `|| true` on failing gates
✅ Fix the root cause; keep diffs scoped to the request
```
